WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Offline is a product state. Keep essential work safe through disconnection and recovery.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Name the essential work.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Cache only minimum trusted data.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Queue actions with visible status.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Resolve conflicts during recovery.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Design disconnection before it happens.
